# Common modifiers first

- Author with an existing `CharacteristicModifier` or `FeatureEffect` kind when one fits. Add a new catalog type only when the idea is reusable and user-editable.
- Wire through `linkedModifiers` / enrichment presets / detect rules. Users must be able to change the same effect on the Compendium row.
- Do not add `if (name === "…")` class or feature branches in `lib/character/` or React when a modifier can express it.
- Pick CharacteristicModifier vs FeatureEffect using `docs/modifier-vs-feature-effect.md`.
